   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ECR202 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 10 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 11335 · Decision 358/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 03/04/2024 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ECR202 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>10 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 11335 · QĐ 358/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 03/04/2024 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>LO1</strong></td><td>Use different reading strategies for different tasks, identify what critical reading is (and what it is not); understand the importance of critical reading skill; make questions and find answers as you read critically; differentiate between critical reading and other reading strategies; Develop and integrate criticality into reading practices.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>Evaluate whether or not a text is academic; describe the peer-review process works; evaluate why peer-reviewed texts are preferable for academic study; understand the importance of the publication date of a text</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>Analyze the importance of knowing something about the author of a text and the people quoted by the author; recognize and reason bias</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>Identify the author’s stance; how the author’s intended audience influences the text; why the author’s purpose is important</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Distinguish facts from opinions</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>Evaluate conclusions drawn from author experience; recognize the steps of the scientific method; evaluate important information as reading reports of empirical research</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>CLO7</strong></td><td>Identify and evaluate evidence not based on author experience: anecdotes, visual items, statistics and quotations from others; how authors try to persuade readers using no evidence at all; how to evaluate these kinds of evidence</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>8</td><td><strong>CLO8</strong></td><td>Analyze the importance of considering the text in its broader context; recognize a school of thought and understand the importance of knowing the schools of thought in your area of study; how to approach a text that presents an opinion or theory very different from anything else you have read</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>9</td><td><strong>CLO9</strong></td><td>Explain why it is important to ask yourself whether the text supports your own experiences; why it can be difficult to do this</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>10</td><td><strong>CLO10</strong></td><td>Analyze the key components of a critical review; differentiate between a critical review and a research essay; structure a critical review</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11335\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11335</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11335\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11335</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
