   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ECR202 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.4</span>\n<h2>Textbooks, materials & tools the university names</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Main textbook: <strong>Critical Reading - English for Academic Purposes, Pearson (2015)<br><br>(For teachers:<br><br>+ My eLab Documents<br><br>+ For teacher: <a href=\"http://gsi.berkeley.edu/media/Reading.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://gsi.berkeley.edu/media/Reading.pdf</a> (Teaching Critical Reading))</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 11335 · Decision 358/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 03/04/2024 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ECR202 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.4</span>\n<h2>Giáo trình, tài liệu & công cụ trường quy định</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Giáo trình chính: <strong>Critical Reading - English for Academic Purposes, Pearson (2015)<br><br>(For teachers:<br><br>+ My eLab Documents<br><br>+ For teacher: <a href=\"http://gsi.berkeley.edu/media/Reading.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://gsi.berkeley.edu/media/Reading.pdf</a> (Teaching Critical Reading))</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 11335 · QĐ 358/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 03/04/2024 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Material<br><small>Tài liệu</small></th><th>Author<br><small>Tác giả</small></th><th>Publisher<br><small>NXB</small></th><th>Year<br><small>Năm</small></th><th>Edition<br><small>Lần xuất bản</small></th><th>ISBN</th><th>Main<br><small>Chính</small></th><th>Hard copy<br><small>Bản in</small></th><th>Online</th><th>Note<br><small>Ghi chú</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Critical Reading - English for Academic Purposes, Pearson (2015)<br><br>(For teachers:<br><br>+ My eLab Documents<br><br>+ For teacher: <a href=\"http://gsi.berkeley.edu/media/Reading.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://gsi.berkeley.edu/media/Reading.pdf</a> (Teaching Critical Reading))</strong></td><td></td><td>Pearson</td><td>2015</td><td></td><td><code>9782761356541</code></td><td>✔</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Critical Thinking, Reading, and Writing - A Brief Guide to Argument, 8th Edition (soft copy) - Bedford/St. Martin’s</strong></td><td>Bedford/St. Martin’s</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>Mindscapes: Critical Reading Skills and Strategies</strong></td><td></td><td>Cengage Learning</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>English Newspapers/ Journals</strong></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong><a href=\"http://www.bbc.co.uk/learningenglish/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.bbc.co.uk/learningenglish/</a></strong></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong><a href=\"https://www.heraldsun.com.au/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.heraldsun.com.au/</a></strong></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong><a href=\"https://vietnamnews.vn/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://vietnamnews.vn/</a></strong></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>8</td><td><strong>Ted Talks</strong></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Tools</h3>\n<p>Tools: Foxit pdf editor<br><br>Internet access</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Materials with no author/ISBN (slides, exercise packs…) are usually internal files you download inside FLM with your FPT account. Buy the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed — page and exercise numbers change between editions.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Công cụ</h3>\n<p>Tools: Foxit pdf editor<br><br>Internet access</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN (slide, bộ bài tập…) thường là file nội bộ, tải trong FLM bằng tài khoản FPT. Mua đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng — số trang, số bài tập đổi giữa các bản.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11335\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11335</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11335\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11335</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
